cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: Animo
type: software
url: https://reproducible-reporting.github.io/animo
abstract: >-
  Animo is a proof-of-concept presentation package for typst
  in which the content of a slide and its animation are separated.
  The body of a slide declares what is on it and tags the parts a timeline may address,
  while the animation argument declares when and how those parts
  appear, move, scale, change style and change content.
  One source file compiles to an HTML presentation, a presentation PDF,
  a handout PDF and handout SVG pages.
